<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 9/10.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 9/10.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Thursday, April 10 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>			10.04.97     09.04.97</p>
<p>    USD	     4.0000	 4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	     6.4960	 6.4980</p>
<p>    DEM	     2.3275	 2.3354</p>
<p>    ECU	     4.5510	 4.5662</p>
<p>    100JPY	  3.1573	 3.1802</p>
<p>    SEK	     0.5206	 0.5211</p>
<p>    FIM	     0.7796	 0.7822</p>
<p>    EKK	     0.2911	 0.2920</p>
<p>    LAT	     6.8452	 6.8522</p>
<p>    1000RUR	 0.6967	 0.6974</p>
<p>    PLN	     1.2847	 1.2863</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
